  "concept": {
    "movement": "Four actual taloned legs carry a steady low torso. A deliberate four-beat walk changes to a brisk diagonal trot with full matched recovery and no stutter step. The hooked face remains forward;body-rooted feather mantle stays attached and the long tail follows from its centered base.",
